{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "buildCommand": null,
  "installCommand": null,
  "outputDirectory": "web",
  "framework": null,
  "//ignoreCommand": [
    "Vercel despliega en CADA push, de cualquier rama. Este repositorio",
    "recibe muchos push que no tocan la web —packaging, tests, workflows— y",
    "cada uno gastaba un deploy. Se llegó al techo del plan gratuito:",
    "  Resource is limited - try again in 24 hours",
    "  (more than 100, code: api-deployments-free-per-day)",
    "y ahí deja de desplegarse también lo que SÍ cambió la web.",
    "",
    "El comando decide si vale la pena construir: sale 0 (saltear) cuando el",
    "commit no tocó web/ ni esta configuración, y 1 (construir) cuando sí.",
    "Si HEAD^ no existe —primer deploy, clon sin historia— falla con otro",
    "código y Vercel construye igual, que es el default seguro."
  ],
  "ignoreCommand": "git diff --quiet HEAD^ HEAD -- web/ vercel.json",
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "trailingSlash": true,
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/es/index.html",
      "destination": "/es/",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/en/index.html",
      "destination": "/en/",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/pt/index.html",
      "destination": "/pt/",
      "permanent": true
    }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
          "value": "nosniff"
        },
        {
          "key": "Referrer-Policy",
          "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-Frame-Options",
          "value": "SAMEORIGIN"
        },
        {
          "key": "Permissions-Policy",
          "value": "geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/assets/video/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/assets/video/(.*).vtt",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Content-Type",
          "value": "text/vtt; charset=utf-8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/assets/(.*).(css|js)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(es|en|pt)/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
